    "body": "Dear $__recipient.name,<br/><br/>\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; color: #333333; line-height: 1.6;\">\n  <div style=\"background-color: #F3FBF7; border-left: 4px solid #00A65A; padding: 15px 20px; margin-bottom: 25px; border-radius: 4px;\">\n    <h3 style=\"color: #008D4C; margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;\">AWS Onboarding Succeeded</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: #444444;\">We are pleased to inform you that your AWS onboarding has successfully completed. SailPoint has deployed the required resources, configured the AWS SaaS Connector, and created your new source in Identity Security Cloud.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 25px; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <thead>\n      <tr style=\"background-color: #F8F9FA;\">\n        <th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: left; padding: 10px 15px; border-bottom: 2px solid #EEEEEE; font-weight: 600; color: #555555;\">Onboarding Summary</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 10px 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE; color: #666666; width: 40%;\">Source Name</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 10px 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE; font-weight: bold; color: #222222;\">$sourceName</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 10px 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE; color: #666666;\">Source ID</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 10px 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE; font-family: monospace; color: #555555;\">$sourceId</td>\n      </tr>\n      #if($adminAccountId)\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 10px 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE; color: #666666;\">AWS Management Account</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 10px 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE; font-family: monospace; color: #555555;\">$adminAccountId</td>\n      </tr>\n      #end\n      #if($totalAccounts != $null)\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 10px 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE; color: #666666;\">Total Accounts</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 10px 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE; font-weight: bold; color: #222222;\">$!totalAccounts</td>\n      </tr>\n      #end\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 10px 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE; color: #666666;\">Deployment Status</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 10px 15px; border-bottom: 1px solid #EEEEEE; color: #00A65A; font-weight: bold;\">✓ Fully Completed</td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n  <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: #333333; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600;\">Account Deployment Details</h4>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 25px; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 10px 15px; border: 1px solid #EEEEEE; color: #666666; width: 40%;\">Management Account</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 10px 15px; border: 1px solid #EEEEEE; font-weight: bold; color: #222222;\">\n          <span style=\"color: #00A65A;\">&#10003; Deployed successfully</span>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      #if($childAccountsTotal != $null && $childAccountsTotal > 0)\n      <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 10px 15px; border: 1px solid #EEEEEE; color: #666666; width: 40%;\">Child Accounts</td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 10px 15px; border: 1px solid #EEEEEE; font-weight: bold; color: #222222;\">\n          <span style=\"color: #00A65A;\">&#10003; Deployed successfully ($!childAccountsTotal accounts)</span>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      #end\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n\n  <h4 style=\"margin: 0 0 10px 0; color: #333333; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600;\">What was completed</h4>\n  <ul style=\"margin: 0 0 25px 0; padding-left: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: #555555; line-height: 1.8;\">\n    <li>AWS onboarding CloudFormation resources deployed successfully</li>\n    <li>AWS SaaS Connector configured with secure delegation roles</li>\n    <li>SailPoint Identity Security Cloud source created and initialized</li>\n    <li>Initial automated connectivity validation completed successfully</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <p style=\"margin: 0 0 25px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #555555;\">You can now view your AWS source in SailPoint Identity Security Cloud</p>\n\n  #set($url=$__global.productUrl + '/ui/a/admin/connections/sources/' + $sourceId)\n  <div style=\"margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n    <a href=\"$url\" style=\"background-color: #0056B3; color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14px; display: inline-block;\">View Source in SailPoint</a>\n  </div>\n\n  <p style=\"margin: 0 0 25px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #666666; font-style: italic; border-left: 3px solid #CCCCCC; padding-left: 12px;\"><strong>Important:</strong> If Agentic Fabric has already been activated for this AWS source, you cannot make onboarding changes through SAF. To troubleshoot or make configuration changes, go to the underlying AWS source in Identity Security Cloud (ISC).</p>\n\n  <p style=\"margin: 0 0 25px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #555555;\">For detailed deployment and onboarding status, including account-level success or failure details, sign in to your AWS account and review the AWS onboarding logs.</p>\n\n  <p style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #777777; margin: 0; border-top: 1px solid #EEEEEE; padding-top: 15px;\">\n    Best Regards,<br/>\n    The SailPoint Support Team\n  </p>\n</div>",
